# A light rain shower.
# An [[aspersorium]] or [[utensil]] for sprinkling.
# A small hard piece of [[sugar]] and [[starch]], or [[chocolate]], used to [[decorate]] [[cake]]s etc.
#: {{syn|en|jimmy<qq:dialectal>}}

